ed API, and feature edge together.\n\nIf the `dlib_rs_auto_fix` behavior change is acceptable, the public `into_legacy_reconciliation_workspace()` and the `but-meta` feature edge could be removed earlier. The internal reconciliation boundary still needs to remain until step 2.\n\nValidation after restoring: `cargo check -p but-graph -p but-meta` and all 144 `but-graph` graph tests pass; the worktree is clean.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:38-43|note=[used prior workspace boundary and compatibility guidance]\nrollout_summaries/2026-07-14T19-57-06-t8iD-workspace_membership_head_minus_target_commit_boundary.md:19-27|note=[used target commit membership decision]\nrollout_summaries/2026-07-14T11-43-16-gmim-workspace_boundary_target_commit_id_vs_target_ref.md:17-26|note=[used membership and status separation]\n<[REDACTED:path]>\n<rollout_ids>\n[REDACTED:entropy]\n[REDACTED:entropy]\n<[REDACTED:path]>\n<[REDACTED:path]>","tool_name":null,"tool_input":null,"source_record":{"timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:21:34.655Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"[REDACTED:entropy]","role":"assistant","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"[REDACTED:entropy]"},"phase":"final_answer"}}}